# Information architecture

TitanOS is an **operating system** for field work and driving careers — not a pile of unrelated pages.

## Domains (keep every feature in one)

| Domain | Purpose | Examples |
|--------|---------|----------|
| **Live** | What is happening now | Driver Hub, Command Center, Jobs, Schedule, Marketplace, Hire |
| **History** | Records of past work / people | Customers, Estimates, Invoices, Leads, Contracts |
| **Analytics** | Understanding performance | Analytics, Reputation, Titan Score |
| **Reports** | Exportable / money summaries | Reports, Finances, Payments, Tax, Receipts |
| **Communication** | Talk to people / team | TitanCom, Messages, Community, Notifications, Follow-ups |
| **AI** | Assistants and coaching | Titan AI, AI Marketing, Growth Coach |
| **Configuration** | Setup of self / business / assets | Settings, Profile, Companies, Fleet, Credentials, Inventory |
| **Administration** | Platform admin only | Moderation, Fees, Tax Rules |
| **Labs** | Unfinished / partner-dependent | Escrow, Deals, Design System, Phone, Emergency |

## Rules

- Prefer placing new screens into an existing domain over inventing a new nav group.
- Live stays ≤3 taps from tabs; History/Analytics/Reports live under More or Explorer folders.
- Driver Hub Explorer mirrors the same split: Live Shift vs History vs Analytics vs Settings.
- Never dump analytics onto Live surfaces.
- Sidebar + MoreMenu must share the same `group` IDs from `nav-items.js`.
